  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0be8df63eb694c41e655f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”虽然是优秀素质擅长的距离，\n但她仍然无法追上东海帝王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96a1d4f8205e700c2e32f1212312eb2a2c8b1f2b5d8141b3d35e47763b3e715d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3c97f650a6e3a4ee1bf356",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质沉浸在悔恨的心情中，\n但东海帝王却鼓足干劲，\n打算立刻为了下次比赛进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecb7609e7352000d8d482bd29368e7279b984fca8c8d277cc65ffabed278df52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cde0e8331e571b819553086",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到这样的她，优秀素质发现对自己而言，\n她真的是远在天边、无法接近的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "372313fb1e5651ea6a10dbff675ce891867e263cccc6950542235603ef758c91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75dc2b93c13089141c2a1ce0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・还没追上",
      "source_fingerprint": "6930e058ec607bd816af3c889cfcf42283f213013ac45702d61fec8bd13132db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e283650c9271ceeb5f892338",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”结束了。\n优秀素质比东海帝王还要早抵达终点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cde1a8b644a19996ad8ea4cbf0a98111c8c567fa828f4dc230e6e9b1772b2b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc36fab4658891266a224d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到即使跑输仍积极向前的东海帝王，\n优秀素质惊觉两人差异之大，为之愕然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdbf38907932ce9c27f90485797921e8be0791cb7c78d5fbfe51909d0a21ded5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc600b45e1079a4484b809c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・不管怎么做",
      "source_fingerprint": "6889485d822b97a57f8a7feef19c733a22c4c9d2518a494344eb9670cf2970f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e6ddba7501ceea6d842c4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质的奋斗未能奏效，\n她并未在“日本德比”上超越东海帝王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df5b82218810c491d9699b58062d55645b0336b5407f8796e531bfd76fd3b3e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa731be7c25611f6381213f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且东海帝王立刻鼓足干劲，\n打算立刻为了下次比赛\n进行更严苛的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ddca2c53c7303fb9ddaf0aa2900ccd1da7eb43e3a89fed1d105ddab9c53f224",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca5882b124dee2086b27a8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到这样的她，优秀素质心生羡慕，\n认为东海帝王才真的拥有\n能够站在聚光灯下的资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8383132ffd9b11df44b42b093f039c4267fd55ea27144f8a5b5633a29ed26887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b51b568b74455c0f63582bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・聚光灯的目标",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a25d3ed84470461fb270cb26a1331ef02fb3673ee7b843cff7114a52af7634",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6c4f6f30165218cd287851",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a360e3245757858510b3ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质顺利回应小仓商店街众人的加油声，\n留下了成果后，\n稍微建立了一些自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4f4031c68d844f3650d78489610e922ca37bdba80c9110b1fd7adf4eef021",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b225fe358fd9061aba2646d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7761f1ecd064c51486c31277",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怀着这股自信的优秀素质，\n为了挑战东海帝王，\n决定参加“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c263ee118937245d6f63178ab0bff2777e7e8ba0f22e014db95af6a250b8f81f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:680ab4872dfa6d422b441709",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5a8cf4f0cdf5806549ea5b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天。要离开小仓时，\n优秀素质收到训练员用折纸做的奖杯，\n说是当作成长的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2726e4076eab524c4d920eeb57be1e74a40c4ba1c21332736b745e74d3e81b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63dd468bcac43891d487d086",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a600dc64b37e107136c97c08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质收下训练员的心意后，\n表示下一场比赛也会加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f16ec953e74dd8f442d999d5b5669cf8641aa7746ef549e4545bbf68ae853ce9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdf984dce6c9c0e688252cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小仓纪念结束后・即使是镀金",
      "source_fingerprint": "62c630931016563e4dbca217cb0c1bd472d3f23af8539d4e80c003f9232a6038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000d30ed58558b7c8e3d4451",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质以令观众印象深刻的表现留下成果。\n她下定决心要在东海帝王复活之前变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0cb80e629a7038445402d6ef2c8b54cecf38a63614778a037121731474058b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba466362075575c693905abf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "归途中──\n训练员拿出亲手用纸折成的奖杯，\n送给以自己的步调跑完比赛的她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d85a546078868cd98f057c2693b76de9bc4fd5798786f9e3ba68bb446c708a96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d81507d1f66a1bdafabd7bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并且判断现在的她\n应该能以“有马纪念”为目标，建议她参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36ba3f894746db3bfe815c1f0fa4384d7d83622b5b2a2f1b370160434eedeca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86f3f406ef28b1788360c891",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了报答平时支持自己的粉丝，\n优秀素质接受了这个提议，\n决定要参加“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70a0978f1615f228ee5ed3e98ad2fdcbee960ed49e9c0347021e2fbe0d92f8db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be847f80d2125041678f210a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・自己的比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd790d20f0f0a97e79bac6d9754cd2bc3906dd45805566281fffac76ad73dad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5546e202ba680dbc3734007b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质称霸“有马纪念”，\n回想起能顺利跑完这场严苛比赛的理由，\n她认为是“多亏有粉丝的加油声”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0a93e2fdbe33715ab6ff1684bcadbc4f598c510a55c3e4c6eff667ce5ed026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:621b38f195907ef91fea3540",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了继续提升实力，\n她向目白麦昆与目白赖恩请教\n变强的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84e87213993ac523f4fc26debc17544a7879df5000434bc4ff40773961567e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ce4c545c41dea296470bbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人答应她，\n之后会好好地回答她的问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dd1c38d8af21d81eb901689c88a9ee62d684b3596b3f4b39e7c09b0204c67c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060426.json",
      "json_path": [
