    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f10742f1f3ee3d1ac971acb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质很可惜地未能取胜。\n但她回顾比赛，觉得已经全力回应\n粉丝们的期待，跑得相当开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb14b3afca4ff23fe7131bfd62b748305c35e21dfc7e0a2b499c5d25977630bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87cc33633979acdc5068840e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了继续提升实力，\n她向目白麦昆与目白赖恩请教\n她们强大的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf68020ca6788dbf0723c277401a3f2b3fe38673f7596aa33e414f876c9db138",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa9e1dd1a3aba74f10270b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人欣然应允，\n约好改天会好好地回答她的问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e9a622f88f5f2092827a87de542c5b4a6c4c85b38f4b52e0597af2959868f74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a418f59dd3df66ae41a89576",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在有预感能获得全新成长的同时……\n优秀素质把下一个目标订为“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aaefc0e8282f94d6a3042ac4b518438d46109a4892958f0db2fbbbe0de247c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060427.json",
      "json_path": [
