    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c87e26fc386238e308c76c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・仰望",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b057678f7955d852696e3eeba4cddf9f824cb11f668fd769ff450be31ccd263",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c73ebe78125c5cdac2afdb5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质全力挑战“宝冢纪念”并获得胜利，\n目白麦昆与目白赖恩也都一致给予赞赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5215b9300c7c2aca8bd679ce7bd26a8dff826ab708de0c483b7a8d10a892885d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27a2e389be90c94a301646b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人即使跑输也没有一丝悔恨，\n反倒燃起对下次比赛的热情，\n让优秀素质也十分感动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "115950702481fb1f4bbb0ff749ff9ed4ecd39a4306a50f5bb1650760386b52b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cf387881d9aea744e434b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员深信现在的她\n即使登上大舞台也能带着自信奔驰，\n于是建议她参加秋季的“天皇赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed9b1d5e8267dcf62ba140bb3d279b45718a832c93fe45a611d89378a7e41aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d23f2f9cdca49eb54a42e52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质激励着差点退缩的自己，\n下定决心要挑战大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9883607af42b5a392df3d460feb72cbb1dcfdb0d8372cf2480cce958aa2155",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7581f4629bdc313f8a781b4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・触及的指尖",
      "source_fingerprint": "b932db90b65fb7f49afd7529b1c020d4836328efa944a5526b1b1bfcfe2d1e89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bbf310755c8fd97a0650328",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然跑输了比赛，但优秀素质已经不是\n以前的她了。她积极地发誓，\n要将这次的落败经验活用于未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f565b73506cfa02b0bad710abf29e3398925ce3dcaaf9e19717d1d3f171de020",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c225d7fb23a56b57e98f89f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆与目白赖恩也跟她一样\n即将为了下次比赛展开训练。\n她跟两人约好要再次交手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3592b9498e6f327436d763992ef627b659004fdd204faec59d71aaa7bf2e51c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74bb1faca8b3c7144e1ec3b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员深信现在的她\n即使登上大舞台也能带着自信奔驰，\n于是建议她参加秋季的“天皇赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed9b1d5e8267dcf62ba140bb3d279b45718a832c93fe45a611d89378a7e41aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5b358675c20b27e4b6628a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质激励着差点退缩的自己，\n下定决心要挑战大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9883607af42b5a392df3d460feb72cbb1dcfdb0d8372cf2480cce958aa2155",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060429.json",
      "json_path": [
